  </data>
  <data name="Ready_Firmware_Bios_Title" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Old startup mode (BIOS, Legacy)</value>
  </data>
  <data name="Ready_Firmware_Bios_Message" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Windows starts in the old BIOS mode. The drive starts in this mode too: in the boot menu, choose its entry without "UEFI". To keep Windows, install Linux in the same mode.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="Ready_SecureBoot_Off_Title" xml:space="preserve">
