  </data>
  <data name="Verify_Identical" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>It was written correctly. If it does not start, the cause is in the startup settings of the computer: see the problems below.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="Verify_NearlyIdentical_Title" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>The drive matches the image</value>
  </data>
